DESCRIPTION >
    Wave-3 flexible_report BASE-CASE (base-gated, mirrors #111 / session_report_pageviews).
    Sessions denominator for the conversion_rate metric — count of distinct visitors per
    source, over $pageview. Faithful port of the BASE case of the sessSql in getFlexibleReport
    (api/lib/attribution-engine.js, queryName 'flexible_sessions', fires only when
    metric === 'conversion_rate'). NON-MONEY-RAIL (visitor count, no revenue).

    BASE CASE ONLY — the live sessSql interpolates dynamic machinery
    (${dimExpr}${dim2Expr}${refJoin}${customJoin}${filterClauses}); this pipe reproduces the
    single narrow slice: dim = source for the FIRST_TOUCH model
    (GROUP_COLUMNS['source']['first_touch'] = COALESCE(NULLIF(properties.first_touch_source,''),
    'direct')), single dim (no dim2), NO custom_param (no customJoin/_cust), NO date-refJoin,
    NO filters. Everything else (other dims, last_touch/linear/ai/non_direct source variants,
    dim2, custom_param, date attributeBy, any of the 9 filters) MUST fall through to HogQL via
    the wiring gate.

    MODEL: first_touch is the confirmed-common model for source-grouped sessions in the code
    callers (api/routes/ai-analytics.js:30-33,187-190 — zero last_touch/linear sessions calls).
    Supersedes PR #115 (which scoped source=utm_source = the last_touch/linear variant the
    callers don't exercise). last_touch/linear source stays on HogQL (base-gate A-strategy).

    EXACT-MATCH NOTE: ported verbatim from GROUP_COLUMNS['source']['first_touch'] —
    COALESCE(NULLIF(first_touch_source,''),'direct'), NO toString() wrapper (the live lookup
    has none; do not add one). §2.6 typed: properties.site_id->site_id, event->event_type,
    properties.first_touch_source->first_touch_source (TYPED column, LowCardinality(Nullable(
    String)) in events.datasource:37 — direct read, not JSONExtractString). ''-vs-NULL collapsed
    by COALESCE(NULLIF(...),'direct') — no divergence. count(DISTINCT distinct_id) mirrored
    literally (exact under default count_distinct_implementation=uniqExact). Half-open window.
    VALUE-PARITY NOT RUN — orchestrator value-gates (count(DISTINCT) match, first_touch) before wiring.

NODE flexible_sessions_by_site_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        COALESCE(NULLIF(first_touch_source, ''), 'direct') AS dim_value,
        count(DISTINCT distinct_id) AS sessions
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$pageview'
      AND timestamp >= {{ DateTime(date_from, required=True) }}
      AND timestamp < {{ DateTime(date_to, required=True) }}
    GROUP BY dim_value
    LIMIT 50000

TYPE endpoint
